octovault (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Simplify vault creation with folder selection and managed key generation.
  * Support existing key reuse and explain image, text, and OpenPGP protection.
  * Manage unlock locations automatically and preserve source carrier images.
  * Guide backup and destination setup with sensible defaults and file selection.
  * Add beginner and advanced controls throughout setup and management forms.

